    expect: 'Switching only changes what you see; nothing is moved or deleted. Next, bring some videos in.',
    keywords: 'tour profiles switch new profile branding logo tagline creator channel',
    videoTitle: 'Quick Tour 01: Switching & Branding Creator Profiles',
  },
  {
    id: 'tour-library',
    title: 'Step 2 · Bring videos in',
    doing: 'List the videos from a profile or link, then choose which ones to download.',
    slot: 'library-grid',
    shotAlt: 'The Library with Download Sources, the link field, selection strip, video cover grid and Download button.',
    steps: [
      'Paste a profile or video link, or pick a saved account in <strong>Download Sources</strong>.',
      'Click <strong>List Videos</strong>. You see every video first; nothing downloads yet.',
      'Tick the videos you want, or click <strong>Select All</strong>.',
      'Click <strong>Download</strong>. Each video becomes a ticket on the Board.',
    ],
    expect: 'Downloaded videos wait in the Board’s first column, ready to prepare. Only import media you own or have permission to manage.',
    keywords: 'tour library bring videos in list videos select all download sources',
    videoTitle: 'Quick Tour 02: Listing & Downloading Owned Media',
  },
  {
    id: 'tour-prepare',
    title: 'Step 3 · Prepare a video',
    doing: 'Each ticket holds a caption for every platform, hashtags, a cover and a transcript.',
    slot: 'command-center',
    shotAlt: 'A ticket open beside the Board showing platform copy sections, live character counts and Copy buttons.',
    steps: [
      'On the <strong>Board</strong>, click a card to open its ticket on the right.',
      '<strong>Fill Empty from Original Post</strong> writes the empty captions from the original post.',
      'Edit each platform’s caption in its own section. The count turns red if it’s too long.',
      '<strong>Copy</strong> puts that caption on the clipboard, ready to paste.',
    ],
    expect: 'The transcript, cover and topic are further down, under Details and provenance.',
    keywords: 'tour prepare ticket caption copy fill empty original post character count',
    videoTitle: 'Quick Tour 03: Writing Platform-Specific Captions',
  },
  {
    id: 'tour-readiness',
    title: 'Step 4 · Check readiness',
    doing: 'See at a glance which platforms are ready and what still needs work.',
    slot: 'command-center',
    shotAlt: 'The Command Center readiness ring reading 4/4 above compact platform check rows.',
    steps: [
      'The ring counts the platforms that are ready. Each row shows <strong>✓</strong> ready, <strong>–</strong> you post it by hand, or <strong>!</strong> something to fix, with the note saying what.',
      'On the card, each logo has a badge: green published, blue scheduled, amber ready, red needs work.',
      'Hover a row or a card to see every check.',
    ],
