    id: 'tour-publish',
    title: 'Step 5 · Publish or schedule',
    doing: 'Reelay posts to some platforms for you; for the rest, it sets everything up and you post.',
    slot: 'command-center',
    shotAlt: 'The ticket Platforms section and bottom Schedule action dock.',
    steps: [
      'Under <strong>Platforms</strong>, set each place the video is going to <strong>Preparing</strong>.',
      'TikTok and Instagram are posted by hand: <strong>Publish…</strong> copies the caption, opens the uploader and shows the video file.',
